    "description": "<p>A being can curl into a ball and quickly roll along the ground. As a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Swift_Action\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Swift Action\">Swift Action</a>, a being can increase his or her base Speed by 4 squares. In this form, the being can only take the <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Move\" title=\"Move\">Move</a>, <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Withdraw\" title=\"Withdraw\">Withdraw</a>, <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Catch_a_Second_Wind\" title=\"Catch a Second Wind\">Catch a Second Wind</a>, <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Drop_an_Item\" title=\"Drop an Item\">Drop an Item</a>, <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Recover\" title=\"Recover\">Recover</a>, and <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Run\" title=\"Run\">Run</a> Actions.</p><p>The being can also spend a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Swift_Action\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Swift Action\">Swift Action</a> to emerge from their rolling form, losing the +4 Speed bonus and regaining access to all Actions he or she can normally take.</p>",
